| `hello-world` | Supabase Edge | Connectivity test only |


## When to Add New Functions

**Add to Vercel (`src/app/api/`) when:**
- The function serves the Next.js frontend directly
- You need to use npm packages (OpenAI, Stripe SDK, etc.)
- The function is part of the user's request flow
- You need Next.js features (cookies, headers, redirects)

**Add to Supabase Edge (`supabase/functions/`) when:**
- The function should run independently of the app
- You're handling webhooks from external services
- You need scheduled/cron execution
- You want the function closer to users globally
- The function reacts to database events
